          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyakuba yindlu engcwele; kodwa njengetshe lesikhubekiso nedwala lokuwisa kuzo zombili izindlu zakwa-Israyeli, abe lugibe nogibe kwabakhileyo eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
